": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LE16wY3dljgQ7kNvwEECXYP&_nc_oc=Adrdsrvpa_VGRk_MWEDMem8YG5xKaUsA-6naDx8KLymNCJndGCgpuZzzYKmBvhcUaz8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKDBeRxnKUB0rh1xfcseuNMZfkQs61r-v82EXZyZcTLHQ&oe=6A9EE11B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qOCfzpSf4hcQ7kNvwEmSAKu&_nc_oc=AdplcPOOEQiza74ycA113M3ufRoWnHRQvT4s_VFaXdMIiw50SCH0m3vdi7BrW0bv2S8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIKS5XjYincXOXr48eqs4R_XN8cJZISUkd4pixA6pPM2A&oe=6A9ED161"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hoe9lI9cPywQ7kNvwEsG3IU&_nc_oc=AdofJRpnZFlYxkExnCsUKl2MZEIW7fsKSI03qUyFt0Z3SUnzoOgbtMJ7SLItFsyUzY4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIMrL01KNzneEeM7tQJ3CGhRaqUhE7S48pUHCidbiCmKw&oe=6A9EBE2F"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RyxogbBFX24Q7kNvwExAiIS&_nc_oc=AdqMMKJgvce3OS8lAHbtlmXxGpXi-A0Q7eSSSSvcHL3wlylhsFF-3R_LKTJJXzqvIJc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLiZ3m-__H16sBtXtMY3lI2sSS0XsSEGLvXJi5GTVdOZA&oe=6A9EBDD2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YLisxChRx9gQ7kNvwGe65As&_nc_oc=AdpAmn0O-X62XF3TQ5bvXtg_Xxe2oDMnmkpbkujszDXgv0jLEyaepXWapZVsbaTpD4g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLK6DY-eyMNqgDRA18WR3i7AqlqZsXe4fPR4oRk3SbymA&oe=6A9EC77D"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a